{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39113","headline":"听赵秀才弹琴 · 韦庄","name":"听赵秀才弹琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满匣冰泉咽又鸣，玉音闲澹入神清。\n巫山夜雨弦中起，湘水清波指下生。\n蜂簇野花吟细韵，蝉移高柳迸残声。\n不须更奏幽兰曲，卓氏门前月正明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}